        "original_id": "47dd6b70-dd3b-5ea9-8d67-0fec0efa5642",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Joseph Bercik\n- Places: Elizabeth, New Jersey\n- Roles: Mayor of Elizabeth, New Jersey\n- Topics: Population, United States Census, Population estimates\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Joseph Bercik served as mayor of Elizabeth, New Jersey, from 1956 to 1964.\n- As of the 2010 United States Census, Elizabeth, New Jersey, had a population of 124,969 and ranked as New Jersey's fourth-largest city by population.\n- For 2015, the Census Bureau's Population Estimates Program calculated that Elizabeth, New Jersey, had a population of 129,007, which was a 3.2% increase from 2010 and ranked the city 210th largest in the nation.",
